      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Kitchen equipment, a hearth, and a well. \r\nNow I can cook a full meal, \r\nand most of the rubble is cleared away!",
        "Jp" : "調理台に棚、釜戸に井戸――\r\n一通り料理できるようになったし\r\nガレキも大方片付いたわ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 627925,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "How is it? \r\nDoesn't it feel like a Great Dining Hall already?",
        "Jp" : "どう？\r\nもうすっかり「大食堂！」って\r\n感じがするでしょ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674959,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Now that we've come this far, \r\nI kind of want to add just one more thing...",
        "Jp" : "でも、ここまで来たら\r\nあと何か一つくらい欲しくなっちゃって――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674960,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Yeah, I think something really special would be nice... \r\nsomething that would make \r\neveryone who comes here happy.",
        "Jp" : "そう、目玉になるようなものがあればなって\r\n来てくれるみんなが喜んでくれそうな何か――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674961,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "No, I'm not dissatisfied with what we have! \r\nIt's just... people, when things go well, \r\nsometimes want even more.",
        "Jp" : "ううん、今に不満があるってわけじゃないんだよ！\r\n――人間、ちょっと上手くいくと\r\n欲が出ちゃってダメだね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674962,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 580,
    "NpcName" : {
      "En" : "Carrie",
