      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "No, no— \r\nThose who arrive here, \r\ntired from their battles, \r\nought to relax a bit...",
        "Jp" : "ううん――\r\n戦いに疲れてここに来るみんなが\r\nちょっと気分をほぐせるような――"
