      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Drinks, maybe?\r\nA little drink to go with the warm meals... \r\nIt would certainly give people \r\nenergy for their daily lives.",
        "Jp" : "お酒、かな？\r\n温かい食事に、ちょっとしたお酒が楽しめたら\r\nきっと日々の活力にもなるよね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674963,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I want a lot of people to gather in this \r\nGreat Dining Hall... \r\nSo I really want a huge keg of wine!",
        "Jp" : "この大食堂にはたくさんの人に\r\n集まって欲しいから――\r\nとにかくでっかい酒樽が欲しいな！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674964,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "That means we'll need a ton of <COL ff2600>[Giant Lumber]</COL>...\r\nSo, where can we get \r\nsomething like that...\t",
        "Jp" : "そうなると相当<COL ff2600>《巨大な木材》</COL>が\r\n必要になるけど――\r\nあったかな、そんなの――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674965,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—Oh, don't worry, \r\nI'll find it myself this time!",
        "Jp" : "――あ、今回は自分で見つけるから\r\n大丈夫だよ！"
