      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Wanting a barrel of wine is, how can I say, \r\nsomething like a little indulgence for me.\r\nI think I shouldn't ask you \r\nfor something like that.",
        "Jp" : "酒樽が欲しいっていうのは\r\n何ていうか、アタシの贅沢みたいなものだから\r\nあなたにお願いしちゃいけないと思うの"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 675962,
